<div class="min-h-screen bg-[#0a0e1a] text-white px-8 py-16 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
  <a href="/" class="text-green-400 hover:underline mb-8 block">← Back to SoccerTracker</a>
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-black mb-2" style="font-family: Georgia, serif;">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="text-white/50 mb-8">Last updated: May 4, 2026</p>

  <div class="space-y-8 text-white/80 leading-relaxed">
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-400 mb-3">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>SoccerTracker collects the following information when you use our app:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
        <li>Email address (for account creation and login)</li>
        <li>Training session data you enter (dates, duration, distance)</li>
        <li>Match results and statistics you log</li>
        <li>Goals you set and track</li>
        <li>Team information you create or join</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-400 mb-3">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc ml-6 space-y-1">
        <li>To provide and improve the SoccerTracker service</li>
        <li>To send you login and account confirmation emails</li>
        <li>To display your personal training statistics and progress</li>
        <li>We do NOT sell your data to third parties</li>
        <li>We do NOT use your data for advertising</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-400 mb-3">3. Data Storage</h2>
      <p>Your data is stored securely on servers provided by Render.com and is encrypted in transit using HTTPS/TLS.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-400 mb-3">4. Data Deletion</h2>
      <p>You can request deletion of your account and all associated data at any time by contacting us at the support email below. We will delete your data within 30 days of your request.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-400 mb-3">5. Cookies</h2>
      <p>SoccerTracker uses session cookies to keep you logged in. We do not use tracking or advertising cookies.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-400 mb-3">6. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:</p>
      <p class="text-green-400 mt-2">support@soccertracker.app</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>